def event_review_done_lane_asks: "- The team for ticket \(.ticket // "unknown") ended a session with a question for \($user). Ask it on the ticket under rule 4: what changes, why now, one closed question, and your recommendation. Do not relay anything to the team: the rules reopen it when the user answers on the ticket. Its question, quoted:\n    | \(.text | gsub("\n"; "\n    | "))";
